{"version":1,"content":"<p>魔音女團MYNT成員倪嘉雯（Carmen）近日在社交網上載跳舞片，身穿露腰裝，又跳舞又向鏡頭單眼，電力十足迷死人，連她的朋友也自動導航跟住跳唱。</p><p>她接受訪問時大方分享跳舞秘訣：「最重要係捉緊手勢！</p><p>『S』字手勢必須做得明顯。</p><p>」本有中國舞底子的她</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:21:35.899835+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:03:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:18:33.348969+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:18:33.348969+00:00","content_hash":"b7b6f278db274dc49bffe1ebef3f8440faf960d29d86017068125bd46c35b072","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}